  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Nastya accidentally broke Chef Barinov's side mirror. Outside the restaurant, the owner Eleonora points out the damage to Barinov. Believing she did it, he takes revenge. We will hear it in Russian first; don't worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, у вас тут зеркало сломанное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Да надо же!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "А вы не заметили?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Что у вас тоже?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "У меня? Как? Где?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Ну вот же.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Теперь мы квиты.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Костя, ты видел?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Он разбивает зеркало её машины.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А она типа не при делах.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я уверена.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это просто так не закончится.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go back through the conversation line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "Виктор Петрович, у вас тут зеркало сломанное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Viktor Petrovich, you have a broken mirror here.' Eleonora points it out.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Да надо же!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, would you look at that!' The Chef fakes his surprise.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "А вы не заметили?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Didn't you notice?' he asks her.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Что у вас тоже?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That yours is too?' He points to her car.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "eleonora",
      "t": "У меня? Как? Где?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mine? How? Where?' She is shocked.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Ну вот же.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right there.' He points to the broken mirror he just smashed.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "chef",
      "t": "Теперь мы квиты.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now we're even.' He feels satisfied.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Костя, ты видел?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kostya, did you see?' Nastya talks to Kostya in the kitchen.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Он разбивает зеркало её машины.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He smashes the mirror on her car.' She recounts what Barinov did.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "А она типа не при делах.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And she acts like she had nothing to do with it.' She notes Eleonora's reaction.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Я уверена.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am sure.' Nastya is worried.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Это просто так не закончится.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This won't just blow over.' She knows the Chef's temper. Let's break down the language.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
